# This repo tracks COSMIC desktop configs for multiple named "rices"
# (see rices/<name>/), each a snapshot of ~/.config/cosmic on Greg's
# Dell E7450 at a point in time. Everything else under ~/.config
# (browser profiles, app caches, unrelated app settings, etc.) is
# deliberately left untracked.

# Ignore everything by default
*

# ...except this file itself, the top-level README, and the rices dir
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/rices/
!/rices/**

# ...except these personal files inside any rice's cosmic/ snapshot
# (Files sidebar bookmarks, wallpaper history) rather than part of the
# actual redesign
**/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicFiles/v1/favorites
**/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicSettings.Wallpaper/v1/custom-images
